Machine Learning Development Life Cycle
    1. Frame the problem
    2. Data collection --> csv, json, web scrapping, API,
    3. Data preprocessing --> missing values, outliers, scaling..
    4. Eda --> visualization, univariate, bivariate, outliers.
    5. Feature selection & feature engineering 
    6. Model training, evaluation, selection.
    7. Model deployment
    8. Model Testing
    9. optimize model